    {
      "id": 1233,
      "__component": "macro-components.faqs",
      "description": null,
      "centered": true,
      "title": [
        {
          "id": 4670,
          "text": "Custom CSS FAQs",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": "#475467",
          "bold": false
        }
      ],
      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2299,
          "header": "Do I need coding skills to use custom CSS in Formester?",
          "body": "Not necessarily, but you will need to write or paste CSS to restyle your form. You can generate ready-to-use CSS with a tool like ChatGPT and apply it through Formester's CSS Selector Mode.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2300,
          "header": "Will my custom CSS work on all devices?",
          "body": "Yes. Every style change is responsive by default, and you can preview how the form looks on desktop, tablet, and mobile before you publish.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2301,
          "header": "Can I undo or reset CSS changes if something goes wrong?",
          "body": "Absolutely. You can revert to the default styles at any time with a single click, or save multiple CSS versions so rolling back is easy.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2306,
          "header": "Can I use custom animations or transitions?",
          "body": "Yes. Add your own CSS animation rules for hover effects, fade-ins, and movement to give your form a modern, dynamic feel.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2302,
          "header": "Can I apply my company's branding across all my forms?",
          "body": "Yes. Pair custom CSS with Formester's Branding Kit to keep brand colors, typography, and button styles consistent across every form.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2303,
          "header": "Will custom CSS slow down my forms?",
          "body": "No. Formester loads CSS efficiently, so your forms stay fast and responsive even with advanced styling.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2304,
          "header": "Can multiple team members edit the same form's CSS?",
          "body": "Yes. If your plan includes collaboration, teammates can edit and review CSS together in the builder without overwriting each other's work.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2305,
          "header": "What happens when I embed a styled form on my website?",
          "body": "Your styling stays intact. Embedded forms keep all of their design, spacing, and animation settings exactly as you saw them in preview.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        }
      ]
    },
